WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.852
OpenRound is organized around a
professional workspace.

00:00:03.852 --> 00:00:06.020
Home summarizes active work.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.132
Library holds Rounds and Presentations.

00:00:09.132 --> 00:00:11.733
Sessions and Assignments track delivery,

00:00:11.733 --> 00:00:16.479
Results collects evidence, and Groups
supports facilitator collaboration.

00:00:16.479 --> 00:00:20.000
Universal search and Create stay available
from the header.

00:00:20.764 --> 00:00:24.004
Creating a Round begins with one clear
choice.

00:00:24.004 --> 00:00:26.236
Use a Recovery starter for speed, a

00:00:26.236 --> 00:00:28.532
trusted document for source-grounded

00:00:28.532 --> 00:00:30.701
proposals, a structural import for

00:00:30.701 --> 00:00:33.890
existing work, or a blank canvas for
full control.

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:36.570
Source and import results remain drafts

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:38.494
until a person reviews them.

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:41.796
The Builder has three working areas.

00:00:41.796 --> 00:00:43.955
The map on the left shows order,

00:00:43.955 --> 00:00:46.924
type, readiness, and recovery
relationships.

00:00:46.924 --> 00:00:49.154
The central canvas is where you edit

00:00:49.154 --> 00:00:51.260
the prompt and responses directly.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.512
The inspector on the right holds settings

00:00:53.512 --> 00:00:55.763
that should not compete with the content.

00:00:55.763 --> 00:00:58.718
Autosave, undo, preview, and publish

00:00:58.718 --> 00:01:00.852
remain in the command bar.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:04.281
Build controls timing, points, and the

00:01:04.281 --> 00:01:06.436
explanation shown after reveal.

00:01:06.436 --> 00:01:09.233
Diagnose captures purpose, required or

00:01:09.233 --> 00:01:13.796
optional confidence, concept keys, and
misconception feedback.

00:01:13.796 --> 00:01:16.490
Recover creates a fresh recheck and pairs

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:18.592
it with the diagnostic question.

00:01:18.592 --> 00:01:20.748
The readiness panel links every blocker

00:01:20.748 --> 00:01:22.903
back to the field that needs attention.

00:01:23.674 --> 00:01:27.501
Presentations have their own grounded
starting methods.

00:01:27.501 --> 00:01:30.156
Bring a trusted PDF, Word document,

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:33.266
PowerPoint deck, or pasted text; choose a

00:01:33.266 --> 00:01:37.590
facilitation starter; or begin with a
blank Presentation.

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:39.607
The conversion is structured and

00:01:39.607 --> 00:01:43.955
responsive rather than a promise of
pixel-perfect slide reproduction.

00:01:44.741 --> 00:01:47.491
Inside the Presentation Builder, content

00:01:47.491 --> 00:01:51.272
slides and interactive questions share one
ordered map.

00:01:51.272 --> 00:01:54.269
Content blocks expose layout, media,

00:01:54.269 --> 00:01:57.101
notes, and accessibility controls.

00:01:57.101 --> 00:01:59.839
Question blocks reuse the same Build,

00:01:59.839 --> 00:02:02.726
Diagnose, and Recover model as a Round.

00:02:02.726 --> 00:02:04.905
You can also insert independent question

00:02:04.905 --> 00:02:06.540
copies from a published Round.

00:02:07.307 --> 00:02:10.267
Preview moves through the authored
sequence.

00:02:10.267 --> 00:02:13.287
Content slides communicate context but are

00:02:13.287 --> 00:02:16.019
never treated as evidence of learning.

00:02:16.019 --> 00:02:18.646
The facilitator controls when to advance

00:02:18.646 --> 00:02:20.879
and when to launch an interaction.

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:24.812
Interactive blocks switch to a
participant-safe view.

00:02:24.812 --> 00:02:27.457
Learners see the prompt and choices, while

00:02:27.457 --> 00:02:29.786
answer keys, private notes, citations

00:02:29.786 --> 00:02:32.305
marked private, and facilitator metadata

00:02:32.305 --> 00:02:34.887
stay out of participant projections until

00:02:34.887 --> 00:02:36.713
the appropriate reveal phase.

00:02:37.474 --> 00:02:39.938
After publishing, use Sessions to host

00:02:39.938 --> 00:02:42.531
live, Assignments for account-free Round

00:02:42.531 --> 00:02:45.124
practice, and Results to review response

00:02:45.124 --> 00:02:46.875
and Recovery Loop evidence.

00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:49.468
Groups lets facilitator teams curate and

00:02:49.468 --> 00:02:52.190
schedule together without forcing learners

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.005
to become workspace members.
